      <p class="figure-caption">Source: https://www.statista.com/statistics/278407/number-of-social-network-users-in-india/</p>
    </div>
    <p>The antecedents leading to the growth of internet usage in India is due to factors such as widespread use of 4G, availability of low cost feature-rich smartphones, access to mobile data, digital payment gateways, and growing use of E-Governance services (Digital Global Review, {{ year_review }}).</p>
  </div>

